{% doc %}
  Shop by brand: brand logo buttons on the tire results line (design board
  Option B, owner 2026-11-15). Desktop: one sliding row of logo tiles
  between the count and Sort by (owner 2026-11-15: "slide them to the left
  on desktop too"), with round Previous / Next arrows at the ends, a soft
  fade on the side that has more, trackpad / shift+wheel / click-and-drag.
  Phones / tablets: the tiles join the one swiping quick row under the
  results head (sections/pt-collection-grid .rd-quick), never stacked.
  Order (owner 2026-11-15 v16): Kumho 4th, Goodyear 11th.

  Rules (owner):
  - Built from Shopify's own Brand facet (filter.p.vendor) on this page:
    only brands with results under the other filters now applied; a brand
    with 0 results is not listed (unless it is the one applied).
  - NO numbers or counts anywhere in the row or the menu.
  - Brands with a logo first, in the order below; then the others A to Z
    as plain bold-name tiles.
  - One brand at a time: a tile applies only that brand (any other brand
    is replaced) and keeps every other filter, the size, the sort and the
    page's own params (rear, view, stock); the applied brand's tile removes
    it. Each tile is a real link (works without JS); assets/pt-rd-results.js
    rebuilds the links from the address bar so params Liquid cannot see
    (rear=, view=, stock=) are kept.
  - Not rendered with fewer than 2 brands, unless one is picked (v16).
  - Staggered sets (rear=): the facet is the front size's, so the JS keeps
    per tab only the brands that tab can show (Sets: brands that make a
    set; Rear only: brands in the rear size; Front only: the facet) and
    hides the row while the sets load or when fewer than 2 are left.

  Logos are Shopify Files (Settings > Files), the same files as the home
  page "Trusted brands" blocks, looked up with the `images` object.
  Vendors match by handle, without a "-tire(s)" ending and dashes
  ("General Tire" = general, "BF Goodrich" = bfgoodrich).

  @param {filter} filter - The filter.p.vendor storefront filter
  @param {collection} collection - The collection (for the link base)

  @example
    {% render 'pt-rd-brand-row', filter: f, collection: collection %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign rb_keys = 'michelin|bridgestone|continental|kumho|pirelli|hankook|yokohama|toyo|bfgoodrich|general|goodyear|cooper|firestone|uniroyal' | split: '|'
  assign rb_files = 'michelin-man-logo-183790o2kam9mn5j.png|Bridgestone-Logo_8cf108ad-7232-4f44-b10e-01c0363fc6b5.png|Continental-Tires-logo.png|Kumho-New-Logo.jpg|Pirelli_Logo.png|Hankook_Logo.png|Yokohama-logo-5100x800-1.png|toyo-logo-web-EN.png|BFGoodrich-Tires.jpg|General_Tire-Logo.wine.png|Goodyear_Logo.png|Cooper-Tire-Rubber-Company-logo.webp|firestone-logo-3000x350-show.png|Uniroyal_Logo.png' | split: '|'

  # Every other active filter (not the brand) + the sort: the base query of each tile.
  assign rb_q = ''
  for f in collection.filters
    if f.param_name == 'filter.p.vendor'
      continue
    endif
    if f.type == 'price_range'
      # Cents -> dollars with the cents kept (100.50 stays 100.50, 100.00 is 100).
      if f.min_value.value != blank
        assign rb_pv = f.min_value.value | divided_by: 100
        assign rb_pc = f.min_value.value | modulo: 100
        if rb_pc > 9
          assign rb_pv = rb_pv | append: '.' | append: rb_pc
        elsif rb_pc > 0
          assign rb_pv = rb_pv | append: '.0' | append: rb_pc
        endif
        assign rb_q = rb_q | append: 'filter.v.price.gte=' | append: rb_pv | append: '&'
      endif
      if f.max_value.value != blank
        assign rb_pv = f.max_value.value | divided_by: 100
        assign rb_pc = f.max_value.value | modulo: 100
        if rb_pc > 9
          assign rb_pv = rb_pv | append: '.' | append: rb_pc
        elsif rb_pc > 0
          assign rb_pv = rb_pv | append: '.0' | append: rb_pc
        endif
        assign rb_q = rb_q | append: 'filter.v.price.lte=' | append: rb_pv | append: '&'
      endif
    else
      for v in f.active_values
        assign rb_v = v.value | url_encode
        assign rb_q = rb_q | append: v.param_name | append: '=' | append: rb_v | append: '&'
      endfor
    endif
  endfor
  if collection.sort_by != blank
    assign rb_q = rb_q | append: 'sort_by=' | append: collection.sort_by | append: '&'
  endif
  assign rb_base = collection.url | append: '?' | append: rb_q
  # The link without a brand. rb_q is empty or ends with '&' (values are
  # url-encoded, so that '&' is the last one): drop it, and the '?' too
  # when nothing is left.
  if rb_q == blank
    assign rb_clear = collection.url
  else
    assign rb_clear = rb_q | remove_last: '&'
    assign rb_clear = collection.url | append: '?' | append: rb_clear
  endif

  # Usable brands: results now, or applied. Unmatched (no-logo) labels go A to Z.
  assign rb_n = 0
  assign rb_active = 0
  assign rb_other = ''
  for v in filter.values
    if v.count > 0 or v.active
      assign rb_n = rb_n | plus: 1
      if v.active
        assign rb_active = rb_active | plus: 1
      endif
      assign rb_h = v.value | handleize | remove: '-tires' | remove: '-tire' | remove: '-'
      unless rb_keys contains rb_h
        assign rb_other = rb_other | append: v.label | append: '||'
      endunless
    endif
  endfor
  assign rb_other = rb_other | remove_last: '||' | split: '||' | sort_natural
-%}
{%- comment -%} v16: also drawn when only the picked brand is left (0 results), so it can be removed from the row. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if rb_n >= 2 or rb_active > 0 -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Tiles (tire results redesign v16, 2026-11-15): the picked brand is drawn
  FIRST (2px ink border, "X, selected. Remove"), then the logo brands in the
  owner's order, then the word brands A to Z. No "Shop by brand" label, no
  "All brands" tile (no brand picked = all brands), no red tick. The row is
  ONE tab stop (roving tabindex, assets/pt-rd-results.js): only the first
  tile is in the tab order, arrow keys move between tiles.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture rb_on -%}
  {%- for v in filter.values -%}
    {%- unless v.active -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
    {%- assign rb_h = v.value | handleize | remove: '-tires' | remove: '-tire' | remove: '-' -%}
    {%- assign rb_img = nil -%}
    {%- for rb_key in rb_keys -%}
      {%- if rb_key == rb_h -%}{%- assign rb_fn = rb_files[forloop.index0] -%}{%- assign rb_img = images[rb_fn] -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    <a class="rd-brand{% if rb_img == blank %} rd-brand--word{% endif %} is-on" href="{{ rb_clear | escape }}" rel="nofollow" data-rd-brand="{{ v.value | escape }}" aria-current="true" aria-label="{{ v.label | escape }}, selected. Remove" title="{{ v.label | escape }}">
      {%- if rb_img != blank -%}
        {%- assign rb_hgt = 160 | times: rb_img.height | divided_by: rb_img.width -%}
        {%- capture rb_set -%}{{ rb_img | image_url: width: 160 }} {{ rb_img.width | at_most: 160 }}w{% if rb_img.width >= 240 %}, {{ rb_img | image_url: width: 240 }} 240w{% endif %}{% if rb_img.width >= 320 %}, {{ rb_img | image_url: width: 320 }} 320w{% endif %}{%- endcapture -%}
        <img class="rd-brand__logo" src="{{ rb_img | image_url: width: 160 }}" srcset="{{ rb_set }}" sizes="80px" alt="" width="160" height="{{ rb_hgt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="rd-brand__word">{{ v.label | escape }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="rd-brand__x" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'pt-icon', name: 'close', size: 16 %}</span>
    </a>
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture rb_tiles -%}
  {%- comment -%} Brands with a logo, in the owner's order. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for rb_key in rb_keys -%}
    {%- assign rb_i = forloop.index0 -%}
    {%- for v in filter.values -%}
      {%- if v.active -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- unless v.count > 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
      {%- assign rb_h = v.value | handleize | remove: '-tires' | remove: '-tire' | remove: '-' -%}
      {%- if rb_h == rb_key -%}
        {%- assign rb_fn = rb_files[rb_i] -%}
        {%- assign rb_img = images[rb_fn] -%}
        {%- assign rb_enc = v.value | url_encode -%}
        {%- assign rb_href = rb_base | append: 'filter.p.vendor=' | append: rb_enc -%}
        <a class="rd-brand{% if rb_img == blank %} rd-brand--word{% endif %}" href="{{ rb_href | escape }}" rel="nofollow" data-rd-brand="{{ v.value | escape }}" title="{{ v.label | escape }}">
          {%- if rb_img != blank -%}
            {%- assign rb_hgt = 160 | times: rb_img.height | divided_by: rb_img.width -%}
            {%- comment -%} Drawn at most 80px wide: 160w / 240w / 320w for 2x and 3x screens, never a width larger than the file. {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- capture rb_set -%}{{ rb_img | image_url: width: 160 }} {{ rb_img.width | at_most: 160 }}w{% if rb_img.width >= 240 %}, {{ rb_img | image_url: width: 240 }} 240w{% endif %}{% if rb_img.width >= 320 %}, {{ rb_img | image_url: width: 320 }} 320w{% endif %}{%- endcapture -%}
            <img class="rd-brand__logo" src="{{ rb_img | image_url: width: 160 }}" srcset="{{ rb_set }}" sizes="80px" alt="" width="160" height="{{ rb_hgt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="rd-sr">{{ v.label | escape }}</span>
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="rd-brand__word">{{ v.label | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- comment -%} The others, A to Z, as name tiles. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for rb_label in rb_other -%}
    {%- for v in filter.values -%}
      {%- if v.label != rb_label -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if v.active -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- unless v.count > 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
      {%- assign rb_enc = v.value | url_encode -%}
      {%- assign rb_href = rb_base | append: 'filter.p.vendor=' | append: rb_enc -%}
      <a class="rd-brand rd-brand--word" href="{{ rb_href | escape }}" rel="nofollow" data-rd-brand="{{ v.value | escape }}">
        <span class="rd-brand__word">{{ v.label | escape }}</span>
      </a>
      {%- break -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- comment -%} Roving tabindex: the first tile is the row's one tab stop. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign rb_all = rb_on | append: rb_tiles | replace: '<a class="rd-brand', '<a tabindex="-1" class="rd-brand' -%}
{%- assign rb_all = rb_all | replace_first: '<a tabindex="-1" class="rd-brand', '<a class="rd-brand' -%}
<div class="rd-brands" data-rd-brands>
  {%- comment -%} Desktop: the arrows show only when the row has more to slide to (assets/pt-rd-results.js). Phones: the tiles join the quick row (display: contents). {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="rd-brands__rail" data-rd-brands-rail>
    <button type="button" class="rd-brands__arrow rd-brands__arrow--prev" aria-label="Previous brands" aria-controls="rd-brands-track" data-rd-brands-prev hidden>{% render 'pt-icon', name: 'chevron-left', size: 18 %}</button>
    <div class="rd-brands__track" id="rd-brands-track" role="group" aria-label="Brands" data-rd-brands-track>
      {{- rb_all -}}
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="rd-brands__arrow rd-brands__arrow--next" aria-label="Next brands" aria-controls="rd-brands-track" data-rd-brands-next hidden>{% render 'pt-icon', name: 'chevron-right', size: 18 %}</button>
  </div>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
